## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### EXP Sustain Cut (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Thunder Belt, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Oracle, Thunder Belt
- Emblem: Basic Common Emblem with Agility, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Revitalize
- Flex: Warrior Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the lane opponent and first gank threat are both physical damage dealers.; Radiant Armor over Guardian Helmet when Use when Chang'e, Valir, Yve, or other repeated magic damage keeps tagging you before Radiance stacks stabilize.; Athena's Shield over Immortality when Use against burst mages who can remove most of your HP before Oracle and Revitalize start paying back.
- Total cost: 11010 gold

Default ranked Uranus build for cutting waves, holding Radiance stacks, and turning Oracle plus Revitalize into repeat side-lane pressure.

### Anti-Physical Frontline (EXP)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Dominance Ice, Oracle, Antique Cuirass, Blade Armor, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Oracle, Blade Armor
- Emblem: Basic Common Emblem with Agility, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Flex: Thunder Belt over Immortality when Use when you can safely basic attack in every rotation and want scaling hybrid defense instead of a revive.; Guardian Helmet over Blade Armor when Use when the enemy damage is skill-based poke rather than crit or basic-attack pressure.; Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when physical damage is high but the real death condition is stun chaining or repeated slows.
- Total cost: 10790 gold

Pick this when the enemy marksman or physical jungler must hit through Uranus before your back line can play the fight.

### Regen Tempo Support (EXP)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Oracle, Radiant Armor, Guardian Helmet, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Oracle, Guardian Helmet
- Emblem: Support Emblem with Agility, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Revitalize
- Flex: Dominance Ice over Guardian Helmet when Use when enemy sustain or attack-speed carries matter more than out-of-combat reset speed.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use when the magic threat is a one-combo burst mage instead of repeated tick damage.; Antique Cuirass over Radiant Armor when Use when the enemy composition shifts toward physical skill damage after lane phase.
- Total cost: 11130 gold

Use this greedier sustain route when Support Emblem's healing and cooldown stats are worth buying Enchanted Talisman for mana stability.

